          "output_text": " To complete the next line of code in the `ProcessFunc` method of the `VideoInterface` class, you should add the video output file and the audio output file to the FFmpeg command. Here's the updated line:\n\n```python\nProcessCmd += \" -c copy \\\"\" + self.VideoOutputLine.text() + \"\\\" -c:a aac -b:a \" + str(self.BitrateNum.value()) + \"k \\\"\" + self.AudioOutputLine.text() + \"\\\"\"\n```\n\nMake sure to add the necessary imports for the `AudioOutputLine` and `BitrateNum` variables if they are not already imported in the `VideoInterface` class.\n\n```python\nfrom CommonInterface import CommonInterface\n# ...\nclass VideoInterface(QWidget, Ui_Video):\n    # ...\n    def __init__(self, parent=None):\n        super().__init__(parent)\n        self.setupUi(self)\n        self.common_interface = CommonInterface()\n        # ...\n        self.AudioOutputLine = self.common_interface.AudioOutputLine\n        self.BitrateNum = self.common_interface.BitrateNum\n```",
